{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that simulates the experience of making in-app purchases in premium games, but without requiring any real money from you. Top-up cards like the &quot;648 recharge&quot; are dropped by defeating monsters, and the top-up system is accessible with a single click\u2014no barriers or restrictions. It is also a feature-rich idle clicker game with a diverse range of systems, including equipment, pets, companions, divine artifacts, runes, and more. Various dungeons, boss fights, and other gameplay modes are all available. Additionally, the game includes premium features such as a VIP system and daily top-up tasks, allowing you to play the role of a high-rolling spender for free and enjoy the thrill of spending without the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033260?t=1761233940","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033260?t=1761233940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033260/32bbd96a1bd2eda4569b55f5f6c0357e165d41b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761233940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033260/32bbd96a1bd2eda4569b55f5f6c0357e165d41b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761233940","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that simulates the experience of making in-app purchases in premium games, but without requiring any real money from you. Top-up cards like the &quot;648 recharge&quot; are dropped by defeating monsters, and the top-up system is accessible with a single click\u2014no barriers or restrictions. It is also a feature-rich idle clicker game with a diverse range of systems, including equipment, pets, companions, divine art